Title: test(network): cover peer cleanup after edge expiration
Body:
Add regression coverage for #16373: when a disconnected peer's last edge expires before the reachability timeout, its reachability record must still be removed after that timeout. The test also checks retention at the timeout boundary and learning a fresh connection to the same peer.

Restoring the pre-#16373 pruning logic leaves all 12 existing graph tests passing, while the new test fails on the retained peer entry. With the fix present, all 13 graph tests pass.

