Title: fix(store): copy child ChunkExtra to cold storage
Body:
Fixes #16177.

At a resharding boundary, `ChunkExtra` contains rows keyed by child shard UIDs,
while the cold-store copy path derived keys from the block's parent layout.
Those child rows were skipped and later removed from hot storage by garbage
collection.

Copy `ChunkExtra` rows by their block-hash prefix so the cold store preserves
every shard UID written for that block. The regression test follows the rows
from their hot-store precondition through the GC window and checks that they
remain available in cold storage.

